  "markdown": "SDGE\n\n\nACCOUNT NUMBER 7397 873 592 9 \nFOR \n\nDATE MAILED Jan 17, 2020\nsdge.com\n\nA [LOGO] Sempra Energy utility\n®\n\n\nDAINETTE R. WOODS\n568 S 36TH ST\nSAN DIEGO CA 92113\n\n\nSign up to go Paperless\n[COMPUTER_ICON]\nSign up to go Paperless today.\nVisit sdge.com/go paperless-today.\n\n\n*Hot weather can lead to higher energy bills. To get a more predictable bill each*\nmonth, sign up for Level Pay at sdge.com/levelpay.\n\n\n✔\n**Bill Discount:** You can save 30% or more on your monthly energy bill. Eligibility is based on\nparticipation in certain public assistance programs or current household income and the number of\npeople living in your home. To apply, call 1-877-646-5525 or visit sdge.com/CARE.\n\n\n**Descuento en la factura:** Puede ahorrar 30% o más en su factura mensual de energía. Los requisitos\ndel programa se basan en la participación en ciertos programas de asistencia pública, o el ingreso anual\ny el número de personas que viven en el hogar. Para aplicar, llame al 1-877-646-5525 o visite\nsdge.com/CARE.\n\n\n✔\n*Savings Alert:* California is fighting climate change and so can you! Your bill includes a Climate\nCredit from a state program to cut carbon pollution while also reducing your energy costs. Find out how\nat EnergyUpgradeCA.org/credit.\n\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">Account Summary</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Previous Balance</td><td></td><td></td><td>$89.35</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Payment Received</td><td>12/03/20</td><td>THANK YOU</td><td>- 89.35</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Current Charges</td><td></td><td></td><td>+ 22.45</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Total Amount Due</td><td></td><td></td><td>$22.45</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nSummary of Current Charges (See page 2 for details)\n\n<table>\n<tr><td></td><td>Billing Period</td><td>Usage</td><td>Amount($)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Gas</td><td>Dec 14, 2020 - Jan 13, 2020</td><td>8 Therms</td><td>13.98</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Electric</td><td>Dec 14, 2020 - Jan 13, 2020</td><td>143 kWh</td><td>8.47</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">Total Charges this Month</td><td></td><td>$22.45</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n***Regulatory Notices***\n - All customers are required to pay a Competition Transition Charge as part of the charges above,including those who choose an electric service provider other than SDG&E.\n\n\nDATE DUE Jan 25, 2020 \nAMOUNT DUE $22.45 \n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">Gas Usage History (Total therms used) \n\n<description>A vertical bar chart displaying gas usage in therms over a 13-month period from August 2019 to August 2020. The y-axis represents 'Therms' with major grid lines at 0, 4, 8, 12, 16, and 20. The x-axis represents months, labeled: AUG 19, SEP, OCT, NOV, DEC, JAN, FEB, MAR, APR, MAY, JUN, JUL, AUG 20. The bars are light blue and show a seasonal trend with lower usage in summer months and higher usage in winter months (peaking in January and February).</description> <table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Therms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AUG 19</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>SEP</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>OCT</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>NOV</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>DEC</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>JAN</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>FEB</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>MAR</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>APR</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>MAY</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>JUN</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>JUL</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>AUG 20</td><td>8</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n8 Therms used \n.3 Daily avg therms \n.3 Daily avg therms last month \n50.0% ↑ Change in daily avg therms from last year \n0.0% → Change in daily avg therms from last month \n30 ↻ Days in billing cycle \n\n<figure type=\"CHART\">Electric Usage History (Total kWh used) <table><thead><tr><th>Month</th><th>Bottom Segment</th><th>Middle Segment</th><th>Top Segment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AUG 19</td><td>~30</td><td>~35</td><td>~25</td></tr><tr><td>SEP</td><td>~40</td><td>~55</td><td>~35</td></tr><tr><td>OCT</td><td>~30</td><td>~40</td><td>~30</td></tr><tr><td>NOV</td><td>~25</td><td>~25</td><td>~20</td></tr><tr><td>DEC</td><td>~20</td><td>~20</td><td>~20</td></tr><tr><td>JAN</td><td>~55</td><td>~125</td><td>~65</td></tr><tr><td>FEB</td><td>~50</td><td>~115</td><td>~60</td></tr><tr><td>MAR</td><td>~30</td><td>~35</td><td>~25</td></tr><tr><td>APR</td><td>~20</td><td>~25</td><td>~20</td></tr><tr><td>MAY</td><td>~20</td><td>~25</td><td>~20</td></tr><tr><td>JUN</td><td>~30</td><td>~40</td><td>~30</td></tr><tr><td>JUL</td><td>~35</td><td>~45</td><td>~30</td></tr><tr><td>AUG 20</td><td>~40</td><td>~60</td><td>~45</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<description>The image is a stacked bar chart showing 'Electric Usage History' in total kWh. The y-axis represents 'Kilowatt Hours' with increments at 49, 98, 147, 196, and 245. The x-axis lists months from AUG 19 to AUG 20. Each bar is composed of three colored segments: a dark blue base, a lighter cyan middle section, and an orange top section. The chart shows a significant spike in usage during the winter months of January and February.</description></figure>\n\n![Electrical Plug Icon] \n\nOn-Peak | Off-Peak | Super Off-Peak \n\n143 kWh used \n\n4.8 Daily avg kWh \n\n3.6 Daily avg kWh last month \n\n54.8% ↑ Change in daily avg kWh from last year \n\n33.3% ↑ Change in daily avg kWh from last month \n\n1.0 Max monthly demand \n\n1.0 Max annual demand \n\n30 ↻ Days in billing cycle \n\nPLEASE KEEP THIS PORTION FOR YOUR RECORDS. (FAVOR DE GUARDAR ESTA PARTE PARA SUS REGISTRO\nPLEASE RETURN THIS PORTION WITH YOUR PAYMENT (FAVOR DE DEVOLVER ESTA PARTE CON SU PAGO )\n\n\nPLEASE RETURN THIS POR\nSDGE [LOGO]\n\n\nSave Paper &   ACCOUNT NUMBER\nPostage   7397 873 592 9\nPAY ONLINE\nsdge.com\n\n\nDATE DUE: Jan 25, 2020 \nAMOUNT DUE: $22.45 \n\nA [VISUAL_TEXT]\nSempra Energy utility\n\n\nSERVICE ADDRESS: 568 S 36TH ST SAN DIEGO CA 92113 \n\nPlease enter amount enclosed.\n$ \nWrite account number on check and make\npayable to San Diego Gas & Electric\n\n\n9589.280.6874.583475 2 AV 0.389 oz 1.282\n[BARCODE]\nDAINETTE R. WOODS\n568 S 36TH ST\nSAN DIEGO CA 92113\n\n\nSAN DIEGO GAS & ELECTRIC\nPO BOX 25111\nSANTA ANA CA 92799-5111\n\n\n[DATA_MATRIX_BARCODE]\n\n\n9 2 10000739787359200000022450000002245\n\n\nCY 10\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01ky3akav3pdsjcz016ncwb0q2 -->",
